    /// the root last. `None` for a CA that is its own root, which is every CA AXIAM generated
    /// before Vault's PKI engine was an option. Present for a `vault_pki` CA, where it is the
    /// only copy of the root certificate anything outside Vault will ever see — a relying party
    /// cannot validate an AXIAM-issued leaf without it, and `root/generate/internal` returns it
    /// exactly once. Optional.
